content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Client",
      "description": "An organization or individual who commissions an advertising campaign."
    },
    {
      "name": "Advertising Campaign",
      "description": "A coordinated marketing effort promoting a specific product or service.",
      "attributes": [
        "Product",
        "Campaign Objectives",
        "Target Audience",
        "Engagement Metrics",
        "Final Design"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Product",
      "description": "The item or service being promoted in the campaign."
    },
    {
      "name": "Campaign Objectives",
      "description": "The specific goals and outcomes the campaign aims to achieve."
    },
    {
      "name": "Target Audience",
      "description": "The group of people the campaign is intended to reach."
    },
    {
      "name": "Engagement Metrics",
      "description": "Quantitative measures of campaign performance such as clicks or impressions."
    },
    {
      "name": "Final Design",
      "description": "The approved visual materials ready for campaign publication."
    },
    {
      "name": "Campaign Proposal",
      "description": "A preliminary plan that outlines the campaign’s strategy and creative direction.",
      "attributes": [
        "Advertising Campaign"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Client Feedback",
      "description": "Responses and comments from the client regarding creative materials or proposals."
    },
    {
      "name": "Marketing Manager",
      "description": "The person overseeing campaign planning, coordination, and delivery."
    },
    {
      "name": "Content Creator",
      "description": "A specialist who writes promotional copy and aligns it with the campaign message."
    },
    {
      "name": "Graphic Designer",
      "description": "A creative professional responsible for visual elements and layout design."
    },
    {
      "name": "Performance Report",
      "description": "A summary of engagement results and effectiveness after campaign launch."
    },
    {
      "name": "Promotional Copy",
      "description": "Text or written content created to convey the campaign’s message."
    },
    {
      "name": "Feedback",
      "description": "Internal feedback from managers to creative staff for revision and improvement."
    },
    {
      "name": "Layout Draft",
      "description": "A preliminary design version shared for client review and approval."
    },
    {
      "name": "Market Analyst",
      "description": "A researcher who studies market trends, customer behavior, and campaign results."
    },
    {
      "name": "Trend Report",
      "description": "An analysis of market patterns that informs campaign strategy."
    },
    {
      "name": "Market Database",
      "description": "A collection of market and consumer data used for research and analysis."
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Supervision": {
      "objects": [
        "Advertising Campaign",
        "Marketing Manager",
        "Client",
        "Campaign Proposal",
        "Client Feedback"
      ]
    },
    "Market Analysis": {
      "objects": [
        "Market Analyst",
        "Client",
        "Engagement Metrics",
        "Market Database",
        "Performance Report",
        "Trend Report"
      ]
    },
    "Campaign Design": {
      "objects": [
        "Content Creator",
        "Graphic Designer",
        "Feedback",
        "Promotional Copy",
        "Layout Draft",
        "Final Design"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Supervision": {
      "derived from": "Supervision Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Advertising Campaign",
        "Marketing Manager",
        "Client",
        "Campaign Proposal",
        "Client Feedback"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Market Analysis": {
      "derived from": "Market Analysis Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Market Analyst",
        "Client Records",
        "Engagement Metrics",
        "Market Database",
        "Performance Report",
        "Trend Report"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Client -> Client Records"
      ]
    },
    "Campaign Design": {
      "derived from": "Campaign Design Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Content Creator",
        "Graphic Designer",
        "Content Feedback",
        "Promotional Copy",
        "Layout Draft",
        "Final Design"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Feedback -> Content Feedback"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
